WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:12.970
40. Bill Gates after Microsoft. Bill Gates is famous because of Microsoft,

2
00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:18.030
the incredibly successful computer company he founded. But what he has done since he

3
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:25.530
left Microsoft may change the world even more. Bill Gates' personal fortune was huge, and

4
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:31.410
he thought he should give more of it to charity. Rather than give money to other charities,

5
00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:37.450
he and his wife decided to create their own. They created the Bill and Melinda Gates Foundation,

6
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:44.530
the Gates Foundation, in 1999. The Gates Foundation operates transparently, which means you can

7
00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:53.050
see how it spends its money. The Gates Foundation has both global and American goals. In America,

8
00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:59.210
it wants to increase opportunities for education and access to technology. Around the rest

9
00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:05.850
of the world, it focuses on health care and poverty. The Gates Foundation uses business

10
00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:13.370
techniques to try to end poverty. It is sometimes criticized for these techniques. It invests its

11
00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:20.090
money in companies to earn more money. But critics say some companies it invests in at home actually

12
00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:26.410
cause problems in the countries they are trying to help. The Gates Foundation also contributes

13
00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:32.730
to very important causes around the world. It supports medical organizations that provide

14
00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:41.450
vaccines to children, treat HIV-AIDS, and tackle problems like malaria and tuberculosis. It provides

15
00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:48.570
money for developing farming in poor countries and helping after disasters like earthquakes. In the

16
00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:54.450
United States, the Gates Foundation works to get the Internet to public libraries so everyone can

17
00:01:54.450 --> 00:02:01.730
use it. It also provides money for scholarships for poor students and supports projects to improve

18
00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:08.810
schools. Bill Gates is one of the richest people in the world. It is only right for him to use some

19
00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:15.290
of his wealth to help other people. His foundation may help him use his money to make a serious impact

20
00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.930
on poverty and disease.
